Package: cipher-rb1-poc
Version: 0.0.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3 (<< 3.11)
Maintainer: CIPHER Platform <anil.0666369@gmail.com>
Description: V1 Phase B.1 R-B.1 proof-of-concept for entry-point registration via .deb
 Minimal POC that bundles ONE Python module with ONE vllm.general_plugins
 entry point declared via standard dist-info/entry_points.txt at
 /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/. Validates that importlib.metadata
 discovers .deb-installed entry points on Ubuntu 22.04 + Python 3.10
 without any post-install Python machinery. Phase B B.1 deliverable per
 V1_PHASE_B_SCOPE_LOCK.md.
